private Optional<Member> validatePredecessor(int ring, Digest from, String operation) {
    Member predecessor = context.predecessor(ring, member);
    if (predecessor == null || !from.equals(predecessor.getId())) {
        log.trace("Invalid predecessor for {} on ring {}: expected {}, got {}",
                  operation, ring, predecessor, from);
        return Optional.empty();
    }
    return Optional.of(predecessor);
}
```

## Impact
- Code duplication
- Inconsistent logging if one changes
- Harder to maintain

## Verification
