Silent SQLException swallowing hinders debugging.

Location: sql-state/src/main/java/com/hellblazer/delos/state/SqlStateMachine.java:780, 788

Current code:
```java
try (ResultSet events = getEvents.executeQuery()) {
    // ... process events
} catch (JdbcSQLNonTransientException | JdbcSQLNonTransientConnectionException e) {
